title Activity view · source admission and fenced redirect · 76282d3
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 21
skinparam activityFontSize 22
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam LegendFontSize 22
skinparam swimlaneWidth 300
skinparam activityPadding 4
|$PROC|ProcessingShortEncoder|
start
:claim + lambda-* binding + COMMIT\ndownload → FFprobe → check_probe;
if (finite 0 < duration ≤60 s\nAND source height ≤1080 px?) then ([true])
 :encode → fenced finish\n+ result outbox;
 stop
else ([NotAdmitted])
 :redirect_to_long_lane\nlock Job / Attempt;
 if (current live lease?) then ([false])
  :return False; no mutation;
  stop
 else ([true])
  :abandon old Attempt + cleanup\nNEW queued Attempt\nstandard work + result outbox; COMMIT;
  |$PROC|Processing publisher|
  :publish_outbox → standard SQS\nasync wake ProcessingLauncher;
  stop
 endif
endif
legend bottom
 Both lanes are Processing. The redirect transaction runs inside the short Lambda.
 Publication is a later invocation; launcher reserves capacity; Fargate claims the successor.
endlegend
